  font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Release notes for version 1.4.8</h1>
<h2>RBAC topology</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Show workloads that use a ServiceAccount in RBAC topology from both Access Control and RBAC Who Can.</li>
  <li>Reuse pod/job cache for workload links instead of refetching every workload on topology open.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Inspectors and tables</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Improve resource inspector formatting, chips, and table sizing for common Kubernetes resources.</li>
  <li>Improve service port and ReplicaSet display to keep tables responsive when the inspector is open.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Stability</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Add focused RBAC topology unit coverage and regenerate native bindings for the new cache-aware APIs.</li>
</ul>
</body></html>
